lisa-design:
- helm appVersion tracks the first org image (values.yaml document order) whose tag is "" (defaults to appVersion) or equals appVersion: mock-app/ccf-app -> api, mock-agent/ccf-agent -> agent. Empty tags stay empty. Chart `version` is left to release-please (helm release type).
- helm edits use yaml.v3 node positions to replace the scalar in the source line, keeping quotes, comments and layout — no yq binary dependency (spec said yq; same effect, testable in-process).
- "Final" release = vX.Y.Z tag, not draft, not prerelease (agent has v0.7.0-rc1 not flagged prerelease, so the tag shape is checked too). Highest semver wins, not most recent.
- Auto-merge via GraphQL enablePullRequestAutoMerge with SQUASH (repos are squash-only per repo-settings).
